			)
		)
		(property "ViaEvidence" "v0.9.9: User corrects raw battery+ versus post-Q1 rail. BATP -> Q1.S (single physical pad/native3, candidate drain); Q1.L/native2 (candidate source) -> U5.4/V011-V014. These are distinct copper nets, connected through Q1. IMG_2438 also supports TP14 on battery+; V015/R43.2-TP14 user confirmation retained. Q1.R/native1 is candidate gate at R44.2. Photo S means SINGLE, not MOSFET source."
			(at 453.39 111.76 0)
			(effects
